(7643879, 1241851, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how you did it!    I see the gun is at his shoe in "real life" and it''s away from his shoe in the reflection?  Or am I seeing things?   And that reflection of the girl... Wow!   Brilliant take on the topic, for sure.  The lighting is amazing.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''d love to know how you did it!    I see the gun is at his shoe in "real life" and it''s away from his shoe in the reflection?  Or am I seeing things?   And that reflection of the girl... Wow!   Brilliant take on the topic, for sure.  The lighting is amazing. ', '2019-10-16 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643880, 1241629, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow, Margaret!<br/> <br/>WOW!<br/> <br/>Please give us the story behind this amazing scene.<br/> <br/>I love her... she played the part so well... and you caught her at it with so much finesse!  The light... those bars... <br/> <br/>Amazingly done, girl!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Margaret! WOW! Please give us the story behind this amazing scene. I love her... she played the part so well... and you caught her at it with so much finesse!  The light... those bars...  Amazingly done, girl! ', '2019-10-16 22:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
