(7643882, 1241966, 114285, '<td valign="top">Loved this, was my fave, thought it might ribbon!<br/> <br/>Very suspenseful.</td>', 'Loved this, was my fave, thought it might ribbon! Very suspenseful.', '2019-10-16 23:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643893, 1241851, 129807, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> I''d love to know how you did it!    I see the gun is at his shoe in "real life" and it''s away from his shoe in the reflection?  Or am I seeing things?   And that reflection of the girl... Wow!   Brilliant take on the topic, for sure.  The lighting is amazing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Lydia! <br/>The reflection must be a matter of physics, because I sure didn''t change anything there about the angles. He was holding the gun out from his leg/foot, so it must be the perspective making it look close to his leg in ''real life''. Thanks for the comment on the lighting as I consider myself completely shit at it and it''s an area I am consciously working on. Cheers.<br/> <br/>And thanks everyone for the comments and votes. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: I''d love to know how you did it!    I see the gun is at his shoe in "real life" and it''s away from his shoe in the reflection?  Or am I seeing things?   And that reflection of the girl... Wow!   Brilliant take on the topic, for sure.  The lighting is amazing.   Hi Lydia! The reflection must be a matter of physics, because I sure didn''t change anything there about the angles. He was holding the gun out from his leg/foot, so it must be the perspective making it look close to his leg in ''real life''. Thanks for the comment on the lighting as I consider myself completely shit at it and it''s an area I am consciously working on. Cheers. And thanks everyone for the comments and votes. :)', '2019-10-17 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643894, 1241974, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like this one - quite mysterious and intimidating.</td>', 'I like this one - quite mysterious and intimidating.', '2019-10-17 10:04:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7643895, 1241984, 129807, '<td valign="top">I too don''t think this needs to be sharper (and maybe that''s a little sharpening artifact around his left sleeve/hand that could be removed?) as the softness adds quite a dream like quality to a film noir shot, like one of those movie scenes where the main character isn''t quite sure if they''re seeing the real thing or something dredged from memory or nightmare.</td>', 'I too don''t think this needs to be sharper (and maybe that''s a little sharpening artifact around his left sleeve/hand that could be removed?) as the softness adds quite a dream like quality to a film noir shot, like one of those movie scenes where the main character isn''t quite sure if they''re seeing the real thing or something dredged from memory or nightmare.', '2019-10-17 10:08:26.000000', NULL, 0),
