(7644044, 1241851, 138630, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually post contest results from here, but this time I posted my 4th place win to my Facebook page because the story about my husband agreeing to go outside in our neighborhood and "lurk" was a little funny.  I also posted a link to the contest results because I wanted people to see how stiff the competition was at the top.  They were duly impressed with both yours and the red - especially yours.  Now my daughter-in-law writes: "So Rob and I both had a good laugh imagining you making David go outside at 9:00 dressed in a costume and pretending to smoke. And you are right, that is some very stiff competition! The picture that won? Wow! Does that person just happen to have friends or family that look like 40s gangsters or did they hire actors?!?"<br/>I thought these might be your kids, but I told her I''d ask.</td>', 'I don''t usually post contest results from here, but this time I posted my 4th place win to my Facebook page because the story about my husband agreeing to go outside in our neighborhood and "lurk" was a little funny.  I also posted a link to the contest results because I wanted people to see how stiff the competition was at the top.  They were duly impressed with both yours and the red - especially yours.  Now my daughter-in-law writes: "So Rob and I both had a good laugh imagining you making David go outside at 9:00 dressed in a costume and pretending to smoke. And you are right, that is some very stiff competition! The picture that won? Wow! Does that person just happen to have friends or family that look like 40s gangsters or did they hire actors?!?"I thought these might be your kids, but I told her I''d ask.', '2019-10-19 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7644358, 1241629, 124815, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, Margaret!<br/> <br/>WOW!<br/> <br/>Please give us the story behind this amazing scene.<br/> <br/>I love her... she played the part so well... and you caught her at it with so much finesse!  The light... those bars... <br/> <br/>Amazingly done, girl! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><b>It''s a museum display. She is made of wax. </b></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh boy, what a disappointment! That''s the downside of looking on the ipad.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by Lydia: Wow, Margaret! WOW! Please give us the story behind this amazing scene. I love her... she played the part so well... and you caught her at it with so much finesse!  The light... those bars...  Amazingly done, girl!   It''s a museum display. She is made of wax.   Oh boy, what a disappointment! That''s the downside of looking on the ipad.', '2019-10-22 21:04:11.000000', NULL, 0),
